    "mechanism": "Across five rounds build transferable repair experience for combinational output timing versus registered outputs, asynchronous reset, input selection between clock edges, next-state hold behavior and event scheduling. Vary defects using prior real repair observations and the original sampled behavior checks. Aim for reusable diagnostic experience, not copies of the held-out defect. Do not emit a solution or assume historical failures still apply.",
